# Raw broker instrument masters kept by scripts/fetch_instrument_master.py
# --keep-raw. 35 MB, re-downloadable, never source. The generated ids are not a
# file: they are stored in data/market.db (reference_sets / reference_rows).
data/instruments/

# The shared database. F&O 1-minute + daily history (scripts/backfill_intraday.py, hundreds of MB,
# re-downloadable); the Dhan gainers/losers history (NOT re-downloadable: back it up); the saved
# broker sessions (live tokens) and clock offset; and the generated reference data (instrument
# ids, weights, F&O list). Never commit it.
data/market.db
data/market.db-wal
data/market.db-shm

